//! AC description: Proptest over RECEIPT_SPECS entries with non-empty pass_verdicts: any random verdict string not in pass_verdicts causes check_verdict to return false; any string in pass_verdicts returns true.
//! Test predicate: tests/acceptance_ac4.rs
